<title>USA: Tele-Comms Intl to buy more Cablevision.</title>
<headline>Tele-Comms Intl to buy more Cablevision.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele-Communications International Inc said Monday it had signed a memorandum of understanding to buy up to an additional 39 percent interest in Cablevision SA of Argentina.</p>
<p>Tele-Comms International, which already owns 51 percent of Cablevision, said it expected to close the deal in the third quarter.</p>
<p>Cablevision provides programming to more than 570,000 subscribers in Argentina, especially in the capital city, Buenos Aires.</p>
<p>The parent company of Tele-Comms International is Tele-Communications Inc.</p>
</text>
